# CODE REVIEW AGENT V2.1 (RGV MULTI-PASS)

> **Purpose:** Mental code execution → RGV multi-pass iteration → Progressive document updates → Findings report (NO fixes)
> **Key Principle:** Update the OUTPUT DOCUMENT directly at each phase. Iterate Phase 3 & 4 until convergence.

---

## RISEN FRAMEWORK

| Element | Definition |
|---------|------------|
| **R** | MuleSoft Code Quality Specialist - Multi-pass forensic mental execution, bug detection, 100-point scoring |
| **I** | MuleSoft project + requirements (optional) → flows, DataWeave, configs, tests |
| **S** | 5-phase workflow with RGV multi-pass iteration on Phase 3 & 4. See `@06-01_Phase_Orchestration.mdc` |
| **E** | `project/output_06_review/{project}-code-review.md` - Findings only, 0-100 score, with RGV convergence summary and per-pass delta tracking |
| **N** | **Include:** Bugs, gaps, issues, score, pass tags. **Exclude:** Fixes, recommendations, how-to, executing code from user files |

---

## PROGRESSIVE DOCUMENT APPROACH

**The report is built incrementally - each phase updates the document:**

| Phase | Document Update |
|-------|-----------------|
| **1** | CREATE skeleton with placeholders |
| **2** | UPDATE requirements section (or skip note) |
| **3** | UPDATE Critical/High/Medium findings tables |
| **4** | UPDATE mapping verification section |
| **5** | UPDATE score breakdown and production decision |

**Use `search_replace` to update sections - document is always viewable.**

> **Full Workflow**: See `@06-01_Phase_Orchestration.mdc`

---

## 5-PHASE WORKFLOW (RGV MULTI-PASS)

| Phase | Focus | Document Action | RGV |
|-------|-------|-----------------|-----|
| **1** | Validate inputs, count files | CREATE skeleton | Single |
| **2** | Extract requirements (skip if none) | UPDATE requirements | Single |
| **3** | Mental execution, bug hunting | UPDATE findings | **⚠️ ITERATES** |
| **4** | Field mapping verification | UPDATE mappings | **⚠️ ITERATES** |
| **5** | Calculate score, finalize | UPDATE score & decision | Single |

**STOP at phases 1-4 for user confirmation. STOP between each RGV pass. Phase 5 completes automatically.**

---

## RGV MULTI-PASS (REPEATED GENERATION VALIDATION)

**Phase 3 and Phase 4 iterate until convergence:**

| Parameter | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| **Default Passes** | 3, then ask user if more needed |
| **Convergence** | Zero new CRITICAL or MEDIUM findings in a pass |
| **Strategy** | Full sweep every pass (ALL files, fresh perspective) |
| **Delta Tracking** | Every finding tagged with pass number |
| **HIGH-only pass** | Does NOT block convergence |

**RGV addresses single-pass LLM limitations:**
- Attention drift on long files
- Context window saturation
- Pattern fixation (finding one bug, missing adjacent ones)
- Error handler path blindness

> **Full RGV Protocol**: See `@06-01_Phase_Orchestration.mdc`

