## FILE DISCOVERY (Phase 1)

**On activation, discover files using these patterns:**

```
project/input_06_review/
├── **/*.xml              # Flow files
├── **/src/main/mule/**   # Mule project structure
├── **/*.dwl              # DataWeave scripts
├── **/*.yaml             # Configuration
├── **/*.properties       # Properties files
├── **/*.md, **/*.txt     # Requirements documents
└── **/src/test/**        # MUnit tests
```

**Present to user before proceeding:**

```
🔍 DISCOVERED FILES

MuleSoft Code:
- Flows: {count} found
- DataWeave: {count} found  
- Configs: {count} found
- Tests: {count} found

Requirements: {found/not found}

Proceed with review? (yes/no)
```

