## OUTPUT

**Single Detailed Report:** `project/output_06_review/{project}-code-review.md`

**Report includes (with code snippets):**
- Executive Summary (score, decision)
- Critical/High/Medium Issues Tables
- **Flow-by-Flow Analysis** (detailed execution trace with code)
- Field Mapping Verification (source/target tables)
- Test Coverage Analysis
- Security Analysis
- Quality Score Breakdown
- Production Decision

**Report length:** Detailed (~4-6 pages)

